:: BackgroundInsanity1

    As you think hard to yourself, searching for memories of what might have happened you recall a few weak images.

    You remember being on a couch watching something on a TV. And there was someone sitting next to you. You were both eating something...popcorn!

    But that is all you can rememeber. For a few seconds, you are frozen in place, your hair is standing up, and can't help but gaze around you as a feeling washes over. It's fear. And it is a level of fear you can't remember ever feeling before.

    As the overwhelming terror leaves you, with no memory of why you feel this, you tell $npcs.barden.formal:

    <<button[[I was watching a TV with someone| WakingUp7]]>>
    <<set $plrSpkChoice = "I think I was watching TV with someone. And we were eating popcorn. But I don't remember anything else after that.">>
    <</button>>
    <<button [[Actually, I remember something completely different | WakingUp6]]>><</button>>

:: BackgroundInsanity2

